{"reviews":[{"id":"B072TZDJXX-0","r":1.0,"t":"Not good quality","x":"Brissles were not straight. I've tried to mold it several times. I'm a nail tech and can't use this brush","h":29,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-1","r":4.0,"t":"Decent buy\ud83d\ude42","x":"Good brush, however the black coating from the handle began to deteriorate.  So I hand filed it off and i'm left with a frosted  looking handle\ud83d\ude05","h":20,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-2","r":5.0,"t":"Fantastic","x":"Fantastic nail brush!! The size holds a dollop of acrylic so you don\u2019t have to dip as much & it doesn\u2019t take as long to complete you set.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-3","r":5.0,"t":"Love love love this brush!!!","x":"I love this brush! It\u2019s the perfect size! It creates clean lines (sidewalls) and hugs the cuticle perfectly! It\u2019s been a long time since I had a brush this good! Well worth it!!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-4","r":3.0,"t":"Not Sure if I like it just yet","x":"When I got the brush I had pieces of the brush sticking out and I had to cut them otherwise I was unable to use it. I\u2019ve only used it once but I\u2019m not sure how I like it just yet.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great purchase!","x":"Best brush I\u2019ve ever owned. I only use this brush for my clients. Nothing different. Will be purchasing more soon. Durable and holds its rounded shape. No shedding guys! I\u2019m surprised too. Love this brush!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-6","r":1.0,"t":"Not worth the money","x":"[[VIDEOID:4c76a1c3819416efa6d8d45ceaac9337]] Brush handle is horrible peeling already wouldn\u2019t recommend the brush to anyone also definitely not worth the money spent","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-7","r":5.0,"t":"Love it","x":"I love this brush! I became a nail tech 28 years ago and lately decided to try n see if I still had what it took to do my own acrylic nails and save money. Well yes!! This brush makes it so easy to do acrylic sets. Just the right size and I\u2019d say I\u2019m a somewhat newbie again, but nails turned out beautiful. Size made acrylic maneuvering pretty easy.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-8","r":1.0,"t":"Brush is ruined after first use!","x":"The brush brissles is good but the black paint melted off the brush when I used it the first time. I had black paint chips all in the monomer and the powder, not to mention my nails before I figured out where it was coming from. I wasted product, the brush is ruined, and I had to redue my nails that had black paint flakes in them.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-9","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!!\ud83d\ude0d","x":"I really like this bush! I will keep ordering these!!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-10","r":2.0,"t":"No what i excepci\u00f3n","x":"After I removed the glue on the brush I noticed the brush hair is split , am a professional nail artist and I know how to remover the glue from new brushes I bought one brush few month ago and The hair was on perfect conditions but this new one it is not","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-11","r":5.0,"t":"Buena calidad","x":"Muy buen pincel solo que si buscas un #8 piden el 6 porque son muy grandes \ud83d\ude25 c\u00f3mo lo que me pas\u00f3 ami ped\u00ed 8 y tiene la presentaci\u00f3n del 10","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-12","r":5.0,"t":"Easy to use brush","x":"A very nice brush. I love the length of the handle. Bristles are nice.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-13","r":5.0,"t":"Great brush!","x":"Fast delivery.. Just got done doing a fill and it worked perfect!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-14","r":5.0,"t":"DIY\u2019er and perfect for me","x":"I\u2019m self taught but I knew I needed a decent brush to make my nails look nice. This brush is the perfect size and I prefer the oval shape. It sits nice in my hand also which is necessary when you\u2019re holding it for awhile. I\u2019ll definitely buy this again when this one wears out.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-15","r":5.0,"t":"Best brush ever","x":"Fast delivery. Perfect handle, excellent quality for the price","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-16","r":5.0,"t":"My Favorite Brush!","x":"I love , these are the only brushes Ive been using since I started doing nails in 2019 , the brush hairs are smooth and don't get clogged easily.  Make sure after each use you soak it in half monomer & half acetone to make sure theres no acrylic left in the bristles , it really helps keep your brush in good condition  The only bad thing is the paint peels/wrinkles but it doesn't bother me & doesn't effect how good it is  I have size #8 , #10 & #12","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-17","r":2.0,"t":"The handle peels off","x":"This brush looked great when receiving but after 3 uses the brush never went back to its shape and the black on the handle was peeling. That was very irritating because it would fall on my acrylic as I was placing it. The nails looked dirty and full of black dots and was very unprofessional. Would not buy again","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-18","r":5.0,"t":"Great brush","x":"Love this brush got it in a size 12 there were a few bristles that\u2019s wouldn\u2019t stay down so i ripped them off other than that it works perfectly and picks up a good size bead. I\u2019ve own a few brushes and this one is by far my favorite.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-19","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect size!","x":"Love this brush! I started doing my own nails due to covid-19 and I was very impressed with the quality, my nails came out SO nice! This brush was the perfect size to get the right amount of product","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-20","r":3.0,"t":"Not happy with the purchase","x":"The brush it\u2019s not firm enough to drag or extend the product in the nail. It opens from the center when you are using it (applying the acrylic). I\u2019m not happy with the brush and with this purchase.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-21","r":1.0,"t":"Not a comfortable hold.","x":"Handle is quite short. Do not like how it feels when I hold it. Rather use my old brush. Also does not come with cover to keep brush bristles from getting damaged.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-22","r":5.0,"t":"La pinta semi redonda","x":"Perfecto agarre y absorci\u00f3n de montonero tiene una pinta que facilita mucho los degradados o el French , pero cu\u00eddalo por que se deteriora r\u00e1pido con la acetona","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-23","r":4.0,"t":"It gets the job done","x":"Brush works well but the black part started to chip away while I was doing a set. I let it sit in acetone for a couple seconds and it came right off.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B072TZDJXX-24","r":5.0,"t":"I love it!!!","x":"I love this brush!! This is my second one. I just ordered it to have a spare and the first one is still holding up and it's been about 6 months.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers love this brush, praising its size, ease of use, and clean results.","cites":[3,4,6,8,10,13,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the black coating or paint on the handle peels, melts, or deteriorates.","cites":[2,7,9]},{"text":"Some reviewers had issues with the bristles, including uneven, split, or protruding bristles.","cites":[1,5,11]},{"text":"Reviewers note the brush holds its shape well and does not shed.","cites":[6,13]},{"text":"One reviewer warns the brush sizes run large compared to the labeled number.","cites":[12]}]},"qa":[]}